<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,453 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,453 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,453 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,451 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 1		   Oct 31</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,453		   5,451</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	5.10		    1.97</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
